WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.544
SERSI
Something's happening to Earth.

00:00:04.258 --> 00:00:05.403
IKARIS
We need to find the others.

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:07.109
SERSI
I haven't seen some of them for centuries.

00:00:08.648 --> 00:00:10.020
IKARIS
Did you hear that, Sprite?

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.356
Family reunion.

00:00:11.406 --> 00:00:12.513
SPRITE
It's about time.

00:00:13.894 --> 00:00:15.602
GEMMA CHAN
It's a really interesting mix.

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:19.323
Having ten characters, we're a big,
slightly dysfunctional family.

00:00:19.597 --> 00:00:20.758
SPRITE
If this is what the end of the world

00:00:20.808 --> 00:00:22.812
looks like, at least
we have front row seats.

00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:23.828
PHASTOS
Well, you know what's never

00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:25.484
saved the planet?
Your sarcasm.

00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:30.786
GEMMA CHAN
She has the power to manipulate matter.

00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:34.271
And she's had a long running,
on-off relationship with Ikaris.

00:00:34.321 --> 00:00:35.451
DANE WHITMAN
How long were you together?

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:36.755
SERSI
5,000 years?

00:00:36.805 --> 00:00:38.372
DANE WHITMAN
I guess you could call that a long time.

00:00:40.186 --> 00:00:42.401
RICHARD MADDEN
Ikaris is the loyal soldier.

00:00:42.451 --> 00:00:43.558
JACK
Dad, that's Superman.

00:00:43.608 --> 00:00:46.084
With the cape and you were
shooting laser beams out of your eye.

00:00:47.404 --> 00:00:48.632
IKARIS
I don't wear a cape.

00:00:49.568 --> 00:00:51.440
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Phastos can assemble anything

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.993
out of any kind of technology.

00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:54.643
THENA
There were more Deviants than you said.

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:56.323
PHASTOS
Well, I'm sure that was fun for you.

00:00:56.373 --> 00:00:57.045
THENA
It was.

00:00:58.342 --> 00:01:00.045
ANGELINA JOLIE
She's the goddess of war.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.337
She can manifest different
weapons, which was very fun.

00:01:06.592 --> 00:01:07.654
DON LEE
He's a protector.

00:01:08.264 --> 00:01:10.195
His specialty's a strong punch.

00:01:12.782 --> 00:01:13.755
KINGO
This is Makkari.

00:01:13.805 --> 00:01:15.409
None of us has
seen her for centuries.

00:01:15.468 --> 00:01:17.008
LAUREN RIDLOFF [in sign language]
Well, obviously she's fast.

00:01:19.001 --> 00:01:20.544
But also, she's loyal.

00:01:21.553 --> 00:01:23.553
LIA MCHUGH
Sprite can create illusions.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.045
She's really sarcastic,
especially with Kingo.

00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:29.719
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I would say Kingo is

00:01:30.404 --> 00:01:31.893
a little self-involved.

00:01:31.943 --> 00:01:33.620
DRUIG
Kingo, the movie star.

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:35.387
KINGO
I've directed some things too.

00:01:37.451 --> 00:01:39.026
BARRY KEOGHAN
He's mind control.

00:01:39.076 --> 00:01:42.227
He stands up for what he believes in
and that there shouldn't be violence.

00:01:42.537 --> 00:01:45.689
AJAK
Don't. We don't interfere in their wars.

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:47.955
SALMA HAYEK
And then there is Ajak.

00:01:48.005 --> 00:01:52.070
She's kind of the leader of
the Eternals. Her power is healing.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:55.617
AJAK
This planet and these people

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:56.870
have changed me.

00:01:57.339 --> 00:01:58.929
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
These superheroes

00:01:58.979 --> 00:02:00.495
reflect the world we live in.

00:02:01.323 --> 00:02:04.082
SALMA HAYEK
Everybody is unique and special.

00:02:06.032 --> 00:02:08.403
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I think Eternals is the most epic movie

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:11.423
that Marvel has done.
And I really, really mean that.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.984
They're really gonna see a movie
unlike any they've ever seen before.

